    "content": "BlackRock has expanded its tokenised share classes to European UCITS money market funds. The initiative brings on-chain share classes to its ICS funds across 15 markets, utilizing J.P. Morgan's Kinexys tokenisation platform to modernize financial operations and improve asset management efficiency.",
